    "sections": {
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/suredash</code> directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; screen in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Navigate to <strong>SureDash &gt; Settings</strong> to configure your dashboard.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='how%20can%20i%20report%20a%20security%20bug%3F'>\nHow can I report a security bug?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>We take plugin security extremely seriously. If you discover a security vulnerability, please report it in a safe and responsible manner.</p>\n<p>You can report the issue through our <a href=\"https://brainstormforce.com/bug-bounty-program/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Bug Bounty Program</a>.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.3.0 &#8211; 29th August 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>New: Compatibility of Resource Library Space with the SureDash premium plugin. (https://suredash.com/docs/setup-resource-library/)</li>\n<li>New: Introducing the Default Colour Palette, Light-Dark Colours setting under the Customize Portal. (https://suredash.com/docs/global-color-palette-explained/)</li>\n<li>New: Introducing Colour Switcher block to allow user to switch between light and dark color modes. (https://suredash.com/docs/fix-global-color-palette-missing-message/)</li>\n<li>New: Introducing &#8220;Enable Like &amp; Share Buttons&#8221; space-level option to control the visibility of like and share buttons for a frontend space view.</li>\n<li>New: Introducing &#8220;Custom CSS&#8221; settings in the dashboard to allow users to add custom CSS for the portal.</li>\n<li>New: Added “Show Hidden Spaces” option in the dashboard, allowing users to restore spaces they previously hid for a cleaner and more concise listing view.</li>\n<li>New: Introduced a new Feeds Icon for the Feeds Page in the side navigation.</li>\n<li>Improvement: Adjusted the entire portal with SureDash default colours for better consistency with light-dark modes.</li>\n<li>Improvement: Updated the single post/page space editor flow fora  better user experience.</li>\n<li>Improvement: Excluded portal login &amp; registration pages from WordPress home page display settings to avoid conflict.</li>\n<li>Improvement: Introduced new filters &#8216;suredashboard_uploads_base&#8217;, &#8216;suredash_user_avatar_markup&#8217;, &#8216;suredash_inserting_default_post_status&#8217; for better customization.</li>\n<li>Improvement: Updated responsive side navigation icon for a better visual experience.</li>\n<li>Fix: Bricks Compatibility &#8211; Themify, Font Awesome icon showing broken on the space frontend view.</li>\n<li>Fix: Link Space &#8211; Resolved 404 error when opening Link Space in a new tab from the admin dashboard.</li>\n<li>Fix: Notifications &#8211; New registered users are getting notifications since the beginning of the portal instead of the registered date.</li>\n<li>Fix: Elementor Pro compatibility: Page transitions causes user logout issue when visiting profile or bookmarks sub-page.</li>\n<li>Fix: Resolved issue where newly uploaded Profile Photo and Cover Image were not showing correctly.</li>\n<li>Fix: Reset password emails now correctly use the updated login page slug/URL instead of always defaulting to portal-login.</li>\n<li>Fix: PHP Error &#8211; &#8220;Uncaught TypeError: array_key_exists(): Argument #2 ($array) must be of type array, bool given&#8221;.</li>\n<li>Fix: Single post preview and portal content now correctly use space-specific layout settings instead of global layout settings.</li>\n<li>Fix: Modern Layout &#8211; Notification count showing double count.</li>\n<li>Tweak: Removed bookmark icon for Space for non-logged-in users.</li>\n<li>Tweak: Improved the dynamic tags drag-drop behaviour to copy the shorthand properties flow.</li>\n<li>Tweak: Smoothen the Portal manager selection &amp; removal workflow from User Roles settings.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.2.1 &#8211; 31st July 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Improvement: Default Rest Password mail template updated with the new {{password_reset_url}} variable.</li>\n<li>Fix: Removing &#8220;Space Thumbnail Image&#8221; still be visible in the space collection frontend.</li>\n<li>Fix: Opened image Lightbox able to scrolls beneath portal view.</li>\n<li>Fix: &#8220;Login to Contribute&#8221; CTA notice visible for non logged-in users even if post comments are disabled.</li>\n<li>Fix: SureCart Compatibility &#8211; Customer dashboard areas are not rendering.</li>\n<li>Fix: Kadence Compatibility &#8211; Global theme palette vars not loading on the portal frontend.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.2.0 &#8211; 25th July 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>New: Introducing &#8220;Copy URL&#8221; functionality for comments, allowing users to easily copy the URL of a specific comment.</li>\n<li>New: Introducing &#8220;Edit&#8221; functionality for comments, allowing users to edit the comment.</li>\n<li>New: Introducing &#8220;Delete&#8221; functionality for comments, allowing users to delete their own comments.</li>\n<li>New: Compatibility of Collection Space with the SureDash premium plugin. (https://suredash.com/docs/create-collection-space/)</li>\n<li>Improvement: The flow of space creation and setting up has been improved with better user experience.</li>\n<li>Improved codebase with best coding practices.</li>\n<li>Improvement: Separated the Space Title &amp; Space Icon fields in the Space creation flow for better user experience.</li>\n<li>Improvement: Duplicated space name for Posts Discussion space type is restricted for avoiding same forum name conflicting issue.</li>\n<li>Fix: Compatibility for Presto Player for their future update to fix paginated posts with media blocks are not rendering properly on the frontend.</li>\n<li>Fix: Comments separator line not appearing properly in continuous comment threads.</li>\n<li>Fix: Duplicated SureDash post falls under the last paginated page of the post list.</li>\n<li>Fix: Google GSI login not working properly in the SureDash Login/Register block.</li>\n<li>Fix: Portal spaces &amp; community content&#8217;s post comments are not appearing under the user profile view.</li>\n<li>Fix: Hidden space creation notification is suppressed.</li>\n<li>Fix: SureDash capability user unable to upload image/video from comment box.</li>\n<li>Fix: Query Monitor shows &#8220;Function _load_textdomain_just_in_time was called incorrectly&#8221; error.</li>\n<li>Tweak: Updated &#8220;Failed to Save&#8221; error message when non portal-manager user tries to save the space settings.</li>\n<li>Tweak: A portal-manager user is deleted from the WordPress user list, then this user is removed from the portal manager list.</li>\n<li>This update addressed a security bug. Props to PatchStack for reporting it responsibly to our team. Please make sure you are using the latest version on your website.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.0 &#8211; 08th July 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>New: Introducing &#8220;User Roles&#8221; filter for Users table in the admin dashboard to filter users based on their roles.</li>\n<li>New: Introduced &#8220;Override WordPress Registration Setting&#8221; option in the Login/Registration settings to allow registration even if the WordPress registration is disabled.</li>\n<li>New: Introduced new keyboard shortcut (CTRL+S / CMD+S) to save the space editor &amp; space group settings.</li>\n<li>New: Added lost-password &amp; reset-password support for the SureDash Login block.</li>\n<li>Improvement: Added better validation notices for images upload in the frontend post editor if image size exceeds the limit.</li>\n<li>Improvement: Introduced &#8220;Link&#8221; option for Reset Password email template setting to allow users to put a custom links in the email.</li>\n<li>Improvement: Refactored the code for dashboard app icon library for better performance.</li>\n<li>Improvement: Added support for searching posts and pages by their ID in the single space post search.</li>\n<li>Improvement: Improvised the flow of user profile form updating and saving process with better user experience.</li>\n<li>Improvement: Optimized dashboard application performance for better user experience with improved codebase.</li>\n<li>Fix: SureForms form CPT posts getting listed in single space post search results.</li>\n<li>Fix: Kadence compatibility: The scroll to top buttons appear weirdly on the portal frontend.</li>\n<li>Fix: Profile&#8217;s Save button isn&#8217;t working on Safari browser.</li>\n<li>This update addressed a security bug. Props to PatchStack for reporting it responsibly to our team. Please make sure you are using the latest version on your website.</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "description": "<p>SureDash makes WordPress a community hub with unified login, custom dashboard, and total control over your data. <span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7syWO6epxnE?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span> <a href=\"https://app.zipwp.com/blueprint/suredash-demo-t6s\" rel=\" nofollow ugc\">Try the live demo of SureDash.</a></p>\n<h3>Key Benefits</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Seamless Integration:</strong> Enhance your WordPress site with community features.</li>\n<li><strong>Customizable Design:</strong> Tailor the dashboard and features to match your brand’s look and feel.</li>\n<li><strong>Scalable Solution:</strong> Add new spaces as needed.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Free Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Custom login and registration forms</li>\n<li>Visual customizer for dashboard layout</li>\n<li>User profiles</li>\n<li>Activity feeds for updates and engagement</li>\n<li>Discussion forums with threaded replies (only site admin can post, but all members can comment)</li>\n<li>Multiple discussions for focused sub-communities</li>\n<li>Giphy integration for animated GIFs</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>SureDash Premium</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Learning management system course builder</li>\n<li>Enable users to post in discussion feeds</li>\n<li>Private discussion feeds</li>\n<li>Resource library</li>\n<li>Events (coming soon)</li>\n<li>Support from our team</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Perfect For</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Membership sites</li>\n<li>Online courses</li>\n<li>Customer support hubs</li>\n<li>Niche communities</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Links</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Visit <a href=\"https://suredash.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">SureDash</a></li>\n<li>Get <a href=\"https://suredash.com/support\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Support</a></li>\n<li>Try <a href=\"https://zipwp.org/plugins/suredash/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Test Drive</a></li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
